91. FINAL STATEMENT
==================================================

Recovery is not merely restarting a service.

Recovery is the mechanism that allows PRSL-AI to remain
trustworthy when something goes wrong.

A failed Router should not erase Context.

A failed provider should not erase Memory.

A disconnected device should not erase Identity.

A failed synchronization operation should not overwrite valid
state.

A failed local model should not automatically expose private
data to the cloud.

A lost confirmation should not become a fabricated SUCCESS.

The ecosystem therefore follows:

DETECT
↓
CONTAIN
↓
PRESERVE
↓
RECOVER
↓
VERIFY
↓
CONTINUE SAFELY

The ultimate objective is not:

"Never fail."

It is:

"Fail safely, preserve what matters, recover what can be
recovered, and never pretend that an uncertain state is certain."

